{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339704-3e-quick-reference","id":1339704,"title":"3e Quick Reference","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-05T14:38:13-07:00","id":1339704,"title":"3e Quick Reference","content":"As I've been digging back into the game-- and as a potential first step towards teaching some of my friends how to play-- I've been working on a quick reference guide. Something that I can quickly look back at if I need to remember something about the crafting rules, but also something that I can hand to new players as a less-intimidating introduction to the game. And I figure hey, maybe you guys would like to see it too? Let me know if you have any suggestions of things I should add, things I got wrong, that sort of thing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/h0tz0ipfuzkzd4n/Exalted%20Quick%20Ref.docx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/h0tz0ipfuzkzd4n/Exalted%20Quick%20Ref.docx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/h0tz0ipfuzkzd4n/Exalted%20Quick%20Ref.docx?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.dropbox.com/s/h0tz0ipfuzkzd4n/Exalted%20Quick%20Ref.docx?dl=0 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-05T15:32:51-07:00","id":1339714,"title":"","content":"Man leave it to Exalted to require 24 page long Quick Reference Guides <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T14:42:21-07:00","id":1340302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epitome</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339704-3e-quick-reference?p=1339714#post1339714\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Man leave it to Exalted to require 24 page long Quick Reference Guides <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I added some stuff (and a bunch of technically-redundant reference tables). It's 37 pages now (:-/) But has I think pretty much everything non-character-specific that I've had to crack open the book for during games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-08T15:18:13-07:00","id":1340308,"title":"","content":"To be fair, it's formatted at a rather large size and sectioned so that sections don't spill across multiple pages when avoidable, so there's space that could be made up to shrink it if desired. It <b>is</b> visually appealing and seems to cover most things. If you wanted to shrink it, you'd be impressed at how small people can read (presuming it's designed to be printed). I have a 9 page cheat sheet someone made on the forums ages ago (<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0ByyxVUUiAnjsLU52MWZNQndFYUE/view\" target=\"_blank\">found</a> it, forum <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/726968-3rd-ed-cheat-sheets\">source</a>) which shrunk it down to fit more on fewer pages. I'm not as big a fan of their formatting and there's some errors so there's value in your version for sure, just offering a suggestion if the length is an issue. This version is NOT better if you plan to read it digitally.<br /> <br /> Anyways, nice work!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-09T12:07:36-07:00","id":1340455,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Unsung Hero</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339704-3e-quick-reference?p=1340308#post1340308\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To be fair, it's formatted at a rather large size and sectioned so that sections don't spill across multiple pages when avoidable, so there's space that could be made up to shrink it if desired. It <b>is</b> visually appealing and seems to cover most things. If you wanted to shrink it, you'd be impressed at how small people can read (presuming it's designed to be printed). I have a 9 page cheat sheet someone made on the forums ages ago (<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0ByyxVUUiAnjsLU52MWZNQndFYUE/view\" target=\"_blank\">found</a> it, forum <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/726968-3rd-ed-cheat-sheets\">source</a>) which shrunk it down to fit more on fewer pages. I'm not as big a fan of their formatting and there's some errors so there's value in your version for sure, just offering a suggestion if the length is an issue. This version is NOT better if you plan to read it digitally.<br /> <br /> Anyways, nice work!</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, true. There are plenty of ways to cut the page count down, but too far and you end up with a wall o'text. I was hoping mine would be more of an approachable Exalted-for-dummies sort of thing, which will definitely bump up the length. I'm glad you like it, though!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-09T12:51:01-07:00","id":1340469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Grod_the_giant</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339704-3e-quick-reference?p=1340455#post1340455\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah, true. There are plenty of ways to cut the page count down, but too far and you end up with a wall o'text. I was hoping mine would be more of an approachable Exalted-for-dummies sort of thing, which will definitely bump up the length. I'm glad you like it, though!</div> </div> </div> </div>The format is definitely more approachable, but 30+ pages as a &quot;simplified version&quot; is still intimidating, in my experience. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Good luck to you!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I post Artifacts in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/823884-3e-the-artifact-and-evocation-workshop\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>. How I make them is in <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/828820-how-to-write-artifacts-and-evocations\" target=\"_blank\">this thread</a>.<br /> I have made many tools and other things for 3rd Edition. I now host all of my creations on my Google site: <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/unsungherovault/home\" target=\"_blank\">The Vault of the Unsung Hero</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/368-the-unsung-hero","name":"The Unsung Hero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar368_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2288"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-09T13:44:49-07:00","id":1340487,"title":"","content":"To comment more constructively, I do like your quick guide. If I were to ST for a new group of players this could be useful to give them as a quickstart guide to Exalted, instead of overwhelming them with the full Core.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-09T18:10:20-07:00","id":1340528,"title":"","content":"Given the amount of stuff that's in here, the size is hardly an Exalted-specific thing. Crack open D&amp;D 5e and cut out:<br /> <br /> * The core mechanic.<br /> <br /> *DC examples<br /> <br /> * Combat actions<br /> <br /> * Damage and healing.<br /> <br /> * The entire weapon table.<br /> <br /> * Travel times.<br /> <br /> * Object durability in the DMG.<br /> <br /> * A basic rundown of all class abilities, but not spells.<br /> <br /> * The vehicle rules in Ghosts of Saltmarsh<br /> <br /> ^ Poisons, environmental effects, falling damage.....<br /> <br /> Plaster all that into one document and it's going to be very comparable. This isn't a &quot;quick reference document&quot; in the sense of a cheat-sheet, it's an Exalted SRD.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24387-amayad","name":"Amayad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"137"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T05:48:11-07:00","id":1340600,"title":"","content":"There are a few mistakes in that sheet that are subtle, but significant, like extended actions' successes only counting above the difficulty. They count FROM the difficulty. Rolling 10 over difficulty 4 accrues 7 successes, not 6.<br /> <br /> I'll review it over the next couple days and get back at you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-10T07:29:02-07:00","id":1340615,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Synapse</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1339704-3e-quick-reference?p=1340600#post1340600\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There are a few mistakes in that sheet that are subtle, but significant, like extended actions' successes only counting above the difficulty. They count FROM the difficulty. Rolling 10 over difficulty 4 accrues 7 successes, not 6.<br /> <br /> I'll review it over the next couple days and get back at you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oof, thank you. I'm tremendously grateful for anything like that you can spot.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12314-grod_the_giant","name":"Grod_the_giant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12314_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"293"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}